//	bridges.gm           train is a 3 minute ride if train does not stop
//                       truck is a 5.5 minute escort if truck does not stop
//  CYBER4WOLF            STOPPED for any reason is bad for axis, its a long distance for each separate vehicle.
//  CONVERSION  lots of hacking and chopping. Lots of editing! many goals do not exist in this version. Paths are going in different directions, locations and elevations than in the other versions.
//=======================================================================================================
// version 2.0 C4W 08.22.2026 Most Waypointing completed, but tweaking and adjustments still required. added more vehicle locations, waypoints & adjusted Defense, added more ROUTE's.
// there are 28 custom triggers to specifically track the location of the 2 vehicles so that the bots can find the vehicles to Escort and Repair the vehicles. 
// Most maps do not require this, but helli_attack required it also. helli_attack is Another ALPHA map.
// Bot files NOT Finished, MUCH tweaking and adjusting needed. 
//=========================================================================================================================
//
//	CYBER4WOLF CONVERSION	08.06.2026			Task: convert bot files __BRIDGES__ to bridges - alpha map
//  Version 1.0 They work, Axis Escorted both vehicles and won but with a NO damage vehicles restriction on allies.
//
//  Version 1.1 BOTZ 08.11.2026 NOT FINISHED so BOT CHAT SAYING TRAIN & TRUCK LOCATION'S IS VERY HELPFUL WHEN CREATING bot files. i will remove it when i am done.
//  Bot files work but this map is 1 GIANT issue, LOL. If Allies Defend the Truck Location & not the Flag location, Axis never win because they never fix & steal the truck.
//  there will be CRUSHED by the Truck deaths ! 
//  
//  TRUCK FIXING LOCATIONS
//  Driver-side => Left-side of Truck is ONLY fixable AT the Truck CAB ONLY & bumper corners on sides!! FRONT of Truck is NOT a REPAIR location!!
//  NO PLACE ELSE ON THE LEFT SIDE IS FIXABLE!!! FIX LOCATIONS ARE RIGHT SIDE of truck, TRUCK CAB both sides, stand on the HOOD or in the BED of truck.
//  The Escort path for the Truck is very narrow, The limited truck fixing locations & distance & narrowness of the Escort road and tunnels make players getting CRUSHED happen frequently.
//
//  Much work is still Required! 
//
//  Due to the Distance the players must travel from spawns to objectives this map always hits the time limit or almost out of time and axis win, KEEP TRACK OF TIME when adding defense!
//  lastbridge_tunnelside_waypoint_1-4 lastbridge_tunnelside_steps_waypoint
//  THIS MAP VERSION HAS NO DAMAGE TO BRIDGES & NO TRUCK BARRIERS
//  It is Just a VERY VERY EXCESSIVELY LONG 5.5 minutes TRUCK ESCORT & 
//  THEN Fix the TRAIN and Go for a VERY VERY EXCESSIVELY LONG RIDE! train is a 3 minute ride if train does not stop
//
//  lots of hacking and chopping, LOL. Lots of editing! many goals do not exist in this version.
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  version 1.5 C4W 08.14.2026 Quality update, 
//  Much waypoint work is still required. 
//  These bot files better than previous version, BUT => Please keep in mind WAYPOINTING (paths) IS NOT finished, 
//  so bot may get stuck, get crushed, fall to death, Train or truck may not be escorted or fixed, etc.
//   Bots play the map without train or truck issues except getting crushed, they still get crushed at times. Not finished.
