//  version 1.7 C4W 08.15.2026 Waypoints unfinished
//
// 
//
//  Tunnels & roads are too narrow so as the truck travels through the waypoint connections they are set as not passable 
//  and most times the Escort will just continue through this, but at times the Escort can fail for a short time because of this. 
//  This non-usable connection issue can effect the bots Repairing of the Truck also. 
//  The bots must PAUSE to re-evaluate their PATH to their OBJECTIVE. Many maps have this condition. More than 1 way to go, this map is a very long way around.LOL
//  Bots must leave the area of the objective and go a different way to get back to the objective area and then complete their objective. A 1 single same Bot does not do this normally. 
//  Bot will try to go long way.
//  (going the LONG way around, the same bot does not generally make it to the objective, another bot will generally go to the objective the long way around and complete it. The closest bot goes until the objective is completed)
